WEBVTT

00:01.900 --> 00:05.700
For a release note, run the packet on its pull request.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Under Warnings, the packet shows the note's published_at value, and its age.

00:14.400 --> 00:21.900
The RSS feed publishes that value as the item date, so set it to the actual publication time at merge.

00:22.300 --> 00:25.300
The checklist at the bottom repeats the step.
